A <strong>Lookbook</strong> is a collection of photographs compiled to show off a model, a photographer, a style, or stylist or a clothing line.<br />
<br />
The feature image represents the cover of the collection to display.";s:6:"parsed";s:0:"";s:8:"keywords";s:0:"";s:9:"author_id";s:1:"1";s:10:"created_on";s:10:"1392614340";s:10:"updated_on";s:10:"1392614340";s:16:"comments_enabled";s:8:"3 months";s:6:"status";s:4:"live";s:4:"type";s:16:"wysiwyg-advanced";s:12:"preview_hash";s:0:"";s:14:"category_title";N;s:13:"category_slug";N;s:8:"username";s:5:"admin";s:12:"display_name";s:12:"Diego Pelaez";}i:1;O:8:"stdClass":23:{s:2:"id";s:1:"2";s:7:"created";s:19:"2014-02-17 05:12:00";s:7:"updated";s:19:"2014-02-17 05:12:00";s:10:"created_by";s:1:"1";s:14:"ordering_count";s:1:"2";s:5:"intro";s:4:"Test";s:5:"title";s:14:"Add a Lookbook";s:4:"slug";s:12:"add-lookbook";s:11:"category_id";s:1:"0";s:4:"body";s:1245:"<h3>Here are the steps to add a <strong>Lookbook</strong>:</h3>
<br />
1. Give a title to your <strong>Lookbook</strong>

<div style="margin-left: 40px;"><img alt="" class="pyro-image alignment-none" data-pyroimage="true" src="{{ url:site }}files/large/93d36fb64c1f1c0" /></div>
2. Add a feature image

<div style="margin-left: 40px;"><img alt="" class="pyro-image alignment-none" data-pyroimage="true" src="{{ url:site }}files/large/5910e2c1f9701ce" /></div>
3. Set the Active status

<div style="margin-left: 40px;"><br />
You can save your <strong>Lookbooks</strong> and publish them in the future, just change the Active option to No and change it back whenever you want.</div>

<div style="margin-left: 40px;"><img alt="" class="pyro-image alignment-none" data-pyroimage="true" src="{{ url:site }}files/large/e0c6372c48ce5e3" /></div>
4. Save your lookbook

<div style="margin-left: 40px;"><br />
​Click the Save button to save your new <strong>Lookbook</strong>.</div>

<p style="margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: ProximaNovaLight, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(87, 87, 87); position: relative; z-index: 1;">&nbsp;</p>";s:6:"parsed";s:0:"";s:8:"keywords";s:0:"";s:9:"author_id";s:1:"1";s:10:"created_on";s:10:"1392613920";s:10:"updated_on";s:10:"1392613920";s:16:"comments_enabled";s:8:"3 months";s:6:"status";s:4:"live";s:4:"type";s:16:"wysiwyg-advanced";s:12:"preview_hash";s:0:"";s:14:"category_title";N;s:13:"category_slug";N;s:8:"username";s:5:"admin";s:12:"display_name";s:12:"Diego Pelaez";}i:2;O:8:"stdClass":23:{s:2:"id";s:1:"3";s:7:"created";s:19:"2014-02-17 05:10:00";s:7:"updated";s:19:"2014-02-17 05:10:00";s:10:"created_by";s:1:"1";s:14:"ordering_count";s:1:"3";s:5:"intro";s:14:"Lookbook Pages";s:5:"title";s:14:"Lookbook Pages";s:4:"slug";s:14:"lookbook-pages";s:11:"category_id";s:1:"0";s:4:"body";s:424:"<img alt="" class="pyro-image alignment-none" data-pyroimage="true" src="{{ url:site }}files/large/5142eca34f5873d" /><br />
